65 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 32 0 R/E(Most participants will already have been part of a VALE Course. Others will be joining The VALE for the first time. For the first time, people from different editions since 2018 will come together in one place to learn from each other and build something new.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

66 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 32 0 R/E(The Forum is not a traditional training course. We provide the structure, methods and rhythm; participants bring their questions, experience and ideas.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

67 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 32 0 R/E(Across five days, we will explore what value-driven leadership looks like when teams work through screens, across borders, cultures and time zones \204 culminating in The VALE Symposium, a public day of talks and workshops in Hamburg.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

